Package: waveslim
Type: Package
Title: Placeholder for 'waveslim' in the AstroSharp macOS Runtime
Version: 0.0.1
Description: AstroSharp's app.R attaches the 'waveslim' package but never calls
    anything from it. The real package depends on Fortran code ('multitaper') for
    which no Apple silicon build is available in the bundled R runtime, so this
    empty package stands in for it and lets library(waveslim) succeed. It
    contains no functions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
